+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+This project's recorded decision for the transport compression codec is **zstd**. The decision config file that recorded this value was later removed from the tree (commit `afba133`, "move decision config out of the tree"), but no subsequent decision has changed or replaced the codec choice, so zstd remains the current recorded value.
